<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC Deputy Secretary-General post to be abolished.</title>
<headline>OPEC Deputy Secretary-General post to be abolished.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The post of deputy Secretary- General of OPEC is to be abolished, the current holder Ramzi Salman of Iraq said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
